{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"buttery-taurine-kinglet","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Problem\nGerrit change 2788 patchset 2 hit a CI-only failure in tests/scripts/test_feature_branch_inventory.py::test_rebased_content_equivalent_branch_reports_merged on ubuntu-latest py3.13. The same rebased tree passed local full `make verify`, including that test, and adjacent Gerrit runs on the same current main completed ubuntu py3.13 successfully.\n\n## Evidence\n- CI run 34147719861, job 101823598582: assertion saw no inventory rows in result.stdout (`[]`) instead of the three fake feature branches.\n- Targeted local reproduction in /Users/joeoakhart/dw1-3f5a passed.\n- Full local verify after rebasing onto origin/main passed.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The feature-branch inventory regression test has deterministic diagnostics for empty stdout, including stderr/exit code.\n- [ ] The root cause of the CI-only empty output is identified and fixed or the test is made reliably isolated from CI environment state.\n- [ ] Targeted test and the normal verify gate pass.\n\n## Testing\nRun `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/scripts/test_feature_branch_inventory.py::test_rebased_content_equivalent_branch_reports_merged -q` plus the relevant full gate before landing.\n\n## File impact\n- tests/scripts/test_feature_branch_inventory.py\n- infra/gerrit/feature-branch-inventory.sh","detected_by":"ci","id":"46be-40e8-db3f-4597","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"CI-only feature branch inventory test emits empty stdout"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788804104785061001,"uuid":"1f756d76-82ab-470e-a0da-cc1d43d9bd61"}